&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;London, UK - Hybrid (3 days from the office)&lt;/strong&gt; team. In this role, you’ll help us define technical solutions for critical business problems and lead the te

